<!DOCTYPE html>
{#
  Landing page for the link in the VeloMelder confirmation email (see
  ReportSubmissionService::submit()/confirmEmail() and PublicReportsController::confirm()).
  Standalone, not extending base.html.twig -- that layout is for the admin dashboard shell, and
  this page is reached by a member of the public who just submitted a report, not an admin. Styled
  to match app/public/velomelder-gelbes-band.html (the VeloMelder tool itself) rather than the
  admin app's own assets/admin.css, since this is a continuation of that same journey: same
  vendored --vw- token subset (see that file's own COMPILE:TOKENS-derived comment for why it's a
  local copy, not the shared assets/tokens.css this app's admin views use).
#}
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>{{ status == 'confirmed' ? 'Bestätigt' : (status == 'pending' ? 'Bestätigung läuft' : (status == 'expired' ? 'Link abgelaufen' : 'Link ungültig')) }} — VeloMelder</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jost:wght@500;600;700&family=Roboto:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --vw-primary:        #ff5544;
  --vw-dark:           #3a3a3a;
  --vw-success-dark:   #3aa84a;
  --vw-bg:             #fafaf8;
  --vw-surface:        #ffffff;
  --vw-border:         #e8e6e0;
  --vw-muted:          #6b6b67;
  --vw-muted-strong:   #5e5e5a;
  --vw-font-display:   'Jost', system-ui, sans-serif;
  --vw-font-body:      'Roboto', system-ui, sans-serif;
  --vw-radius-sm:      4px;
  --vw-radius-md:      8px;
  --vw-shadow-md:      0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04), 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  --text-xs:   12px;
  --text-sm:   14px;
  --text-xl:   22px;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body { margin: 0; min-height: 100%; font-family: var(--vw-font-body); color: var(--vw-dark); background: var(--vw-bg); }
body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; min-height: 100vh; padding: 24px 20px; }

.logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
.logo__bar { width: 5px; height: 26px; border-radius: 1px; background: #dc3406; }
.logo__text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.25; }
.logo__top { font-family: var(--vw-font-display); font-weight: 500; font-size: var(--text-xs); letter-spacing: 0.01em; }
.logo__bottom { font-family: var(--vw-font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: var(--text-xs); letter-spacing: 0.14em; }

.card {
  background: var(--vw-surface); border: 1px solid var(--vw-border); border-radius: var(--vw-radius-md);
  box-shadow: var(--vw-shadow-md); max-width: 420px; width: 100%; padding: 32px 28px;
  text-align: center; margin-top: auto; margin-bottom: auto;
}
.card svg { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.card h1 { font-family: var(--vw-font-display); font-size: var(--text-xl); font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 12px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.card p { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--vw-muted-strong); line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 24px; }

.btn-back, .btn-primary {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 12px 24px;
  border-radius: var(--vw-radius-sm); background: var(--vw-primary); color: #fff; font-family: var(--vw-font-body);
  font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 150ms;
}
.btn-back:hover, .btn-primary:hover { background: #e84a3a; }
.btn-primary:disabled { cursor: default; opacity: 0.6; }
.confirm-form { margin: 0 0 16px; }

.newsletter { border-top: 1px solid var(--vw-border); margin: 24px 0; padding-top: 24px; }
.newsletter p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
.btn-secondary {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 11px 24px;
  border-radius: var(--vw-radius-sm); background: transparent; color: var(--vw-dark);
  border: 1px solid var(--vw-border); font-family: var(--vw-font-body); font-size: var(--text-sm);
  font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: border-color 150ms, color 150ms;
}
.btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--vw-primary); color: var(--vw-primary); }
.newsletter__thanks { color: var(--vw-success-dark); font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 500; margin: 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="logo" role="img" aria-label="Velofreundliches Wetzikon">
  <span class="logo__bar"></span>
  <span class="logo__text">
    <span class="logo__top">velofreundliches</span>
    <span class="logo__bottom">WETZIKON</span>
  </span>
</div>

<div class="card">
  {% if status == 'pending' %}
    <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--vw-primary)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>
    <h1>Einen Moment …</h1>
    <p>Deine Meldung wird bestätigt.</p>
    <form class="confirm-form" method="post" action="{{ path('api_reports_confirm_submit', {token: token}) }}" id="confirmForm">
      <noscript><button type="submit" class="btn-back">Jetzt bestätigen</button></noscript>
    </form>
  {% elseif status == 'confirmed' %}
    <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--vw-success-dark)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 12l2.5 2.5L16 9"/></svg>
    <h1>Bestätigt — danke!</h1>
    <p>Deine Meldung wird nun von unserem Team geprüft. Sobald sie freigegeben ist, erscheint sie auf der Karte.</p>
    {% if newsletterReportId %}
    <div class="newsletter" id="newsletterBlock" data-report-id="{{ newsletterReportId }}" data-sig="{{ newsletterSig }}">
      <p>Möchtest du regelmässige Updates erhalten – vielleicht auch mit deiner Meldung? Abonniere unseren Newsletter.</p>
      <button type="button" class="btn-primary" id="btnNewsletter">Newsletter abonnieren</button>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  {% elseif status == 'expired' %}
    <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c9a227" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
    <h1>Link abgelaufen</h1>
    <p>Dieser Bestätigungslink ist nicht mehr gültig. Bitte reiche deine Meldung erneut ein, um einen neuen Link zu erhalten.</p>
  {% else %}
    <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--vw-muted)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
    <h1>Link ungültig</h1>
    <p>Dieser Bestätigungslink ist unbekannt. Prüfe, ob du den richtigen Link aus der E-Mail geöffnet hast.</p>
  {% endif %}
  <a class="{{ (status == 'confirmed' and newsletterReportId) ? 'btn-secondary' : 'btn-back' }}" href="{{ backUrl }}">{{ backLabel }}</a>
</div>

{% if status == 'pending' %}
<script>
document.getElementById('confirmForm').submit();
</script>
{% endif %}

{% if status == 'confirmed' %}
<script>
(function () {
  var block = document.getElementById('newsletterBlock');
  var btn = document.getElementById('btnNewsletter');
  if (!block || !btn) return;
  btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
    btn.disabled = true;
    btn.textContent = 'Einen Moment …';
    fetch('/reports/' + encodeURIComponent(block.dataset.reportId) + '/newsletter-signup/' + encodeURIComponent(block.dataset.sig), {
      method: 'POST',
    }).then(function (res) {
      if (!res.ok) throw new Error('request failed');
      block.innerHTML = '<p class="newsletter__thanks">Danke! Wir melden uns, sobald es Neuigkeiten gibt.</p>';
    }).catch(function () {
      btn.disabled = false;
      btn.textContent = 'Newsletter abonnieren';
      alert('Das hat leider nicht geklappt. Bitte versuch es später erneut.');
    });
  });
})();
</script>
{% endif %}

</body>
</html>
